Aye shaheede jafa imame Raza,<br>
Ap ke mai fida imame Raza.<br>
<br>
Zeher angoor me layeen mamoon,<br>
Apko dediya Imame Raza.<br>
<br>
Qaak par lot'te hai thaame jigar,<br>
Khake zehre dagha Imame Raza.<br>
<br>
Saro sina hai peet te nikle,<br>
Qabr se Murtuza Imame Raza.<br>
<br>
Fatima qabr se chali aayi,<br>
Karti aaho buka Imame Raza.<br>
<br>
Uthke dekho to milne yasrab se,<br>
Aayi hai Masooma Imame Raza.<br>
<br>
Peet te hain tumhare ghum me sar,<br>
Aj ahle aza Imame Raza.<br>
<br>
Nikle sar apna peet te &lsquo;Momin&rsquo;,<br>
Qabr se Mustafa Imame Raza&#8230;